# Docs source of truth

Before product, domain, architecture, or data-model decisions, read the relevant file under `docs/`:

- `docs/product.md` — product requirements
- `docs/MVP.md` — MVP scope and acceptance
- `docs/DOMAIN.md` — domain model and business rules
- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` — system architecture
- `docs/DATA-MODEL.md` — schema, triggers, RLS

Treat those documents as authoritative. Do not invent conflicting requirements.

If code or a proposal conflicts with the docs, surface the conflict explicitly; do not silently override.

For `CONTEXT.md` / ADR consumer rules (when those files exist), see `docs/agents/domain.md`.
